{"page":413,"verses":[{"verse_key":"31:20","surah":31,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَوْا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَخَّرَ لَكُم مَّا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَأَسْبَغَ عَلَيْكُمْ نِعَمَهُۥ ظَـٰهِرَةً وَبَاطِنَةً ۗ وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يُجَـٰدِلُ فِى ٱللَّهِ بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ وَلَا هُدًى وَلَا كِتَـٰبٍ مُّنِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[People], do you not see how God has made what is in the heavens and on the earth useful to you, and has lavished His bless-ings on you both outwardly and inwardly? Yet some people argue about God, without knowledge or guidance or an illuminating scripture.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"taraw","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَخَّرَ","en_gloss":"has subjected","transliteration":"sakhara","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَسْبَغَ","en_gloss":"and amply bestowed","transliteration":"wa-asbagha","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"31:20"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نِعَمَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His Bounties","translitera