:"(of) the Blaze","transliteration":"l-saʿīri","verse_key":"31:21"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"31:21"}]},{"verse_key":"31:22","surah":31,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَمَن يُسْلِمْ وَجْهَهُۥٓ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ وَهُوَ مُحْسِنٌ فَقَدِ ٱسْتَمْسَكَ بِٱلْعُرْوَةِ ٱلْوُثْقَىٰ ۗ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْأُمُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whoever directs himself wholly to God and does good work has grasped the surest handhold, for the outcome of everything is with God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُسْلِمْ","en_gloss":"submits","transliteration":"yus'lim","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَجْهَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"his face","transliteration":"wajhahu","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُحْسِنٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a good-doer","transliteration":"muḥ'sinun","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَقَدِ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"faqadi","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱسْتَمْسَكَ","en_gloss":"he has grasped","transliteration":"is'tamsaka","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱلْعُرْوَةِ","en_gloss":"the handhold","transliteration":"bil-ʿur'wati","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْوُثْقَىٰ ۗ","en_gloss":"the most trustworthy","transliteration":"l-wuth'qā","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(is the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورِ","en_gloss":"(of) the matters","transliteration":"l-umūri","verse_key":"31:22"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"31:22"}]},{"verse_key":"31:23","surah":31,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن كَفَرَ فَلَا يَحْزُنكَ كُفْرُهُۥٓ ۚ إِلَيْنَا مَرْجِعُهُمْ فَنُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا عَمِلُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who refuse to do this, do not let their refusal sadden you [Prophet]- they will return to Us and We shall tell them what they have done: God knows all that hearts contain-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"disbelieves","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"let not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَحْزُنكَ","en_gloss":"grieve you","transliteration":"yaḥzunka","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُفْرُهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"his disbelief","transliteration":"kuf'ruhu","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"To Us","transliteration":"ilaynā","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَرْجِعُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) their return","transliteration":"marjiʿuhum","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَنُنَبِّئُهُم","en_gloss":"then We will inform them","transliteration":"fanunabbi-uhum","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَمِلُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"(is in) the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"31:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"31:23"}]},{"verse_key":"31:24","surah":31,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"نُمَتِّعُهُمْ قَلِيلًا ثُمَّ نَضْطَرُّهُمْ إِلَىٰ عَذَابٍ غَلِيظٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We let them enjoy themselves for a little while, but We shall drive them to a harsh torment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"نُمَتِّعُهُمْ","en_gloss":"We grant them enjoyment","transliteration":"numattiʿuhum","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) a little","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَضْطَرُّهُمْ","en_gloss":"We will force them","transliteration":"naḍṭarruhum","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَذَابٍ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"غَلِيظٍۢ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"ghalīẓin","verse_key":"31:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"31:24"}]},{"verse_key":"31:25","surah":31,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ لَيَقُولُنَّ ٱللَّهُ ۚ قُلِ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ۚ بَلْ أَكْثَرُهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you ask them who created the heavens and earth, they are sure to say, ‘God.’ Say, ‘Praise belongs to God,’ but most of them do not understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"31:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَأَلْتَهُم","en_gloss":"you ask them","transliteration":"sa-altahum","verse_key":"31:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّنْ","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"31:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"31:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"3